{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7a9k7qt0","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":55,"top":184,"width":1170,"height":82},"text":"CNN（畳み込みニューラルネットワーク）で画像の特徴を学習し、\n検出したい領域を選択的に抽出する。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"游ゴシック","color":"#202020","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6903ylcf","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":55,"top":307,"width":360,"height":148},"text":"例：Le Gentilら（2025）\n反射リングやマーカーをCNNで\n抽出し、幾何モデルを用いて\nドッキングポートの位置・姿勢\nを推定する。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"游ゴシック","color":"#202020","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/k7ilwbu9","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":450,"top":477,"width":780,"height":27},"text":"図：RGB画像からの反射マーカー抽出（Fig. 3(b)）","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"游ゴシック","color":"#202020","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cr2lsv25","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":65,"top":494,"width":1150,"height":42},"text":"【課題】","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"游ゴシック","color":"#202020","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xsvmlgjq","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":55,"top":535,"width":1170,"height":111},"text":"・学習画像と撮影条件が異なると、検出精度が低下する場合がある。\n・強い反射でRGB画像が飽和すると、検出が困難になる。\n・反射リングやマーカーを前提とし、PAF内周への適用は別途検証が必要。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"游ゴシック","color":"#202020","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/apk3qlkz","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":735,"top":650,"width":520,"height":20},"text":"出典：Le Gentil et al., ICRA 2025, Fig. 3(b).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"游ゴシック","color":"#202020","alignment":"left"}}
